128701299b79d238925aeab.600x338.jpg?t=1769444929"}],"short_description":"Sky Dust is a cyberpunk action-adventure Metroidvania set in a S\u00e3o Paulo poisoned by lunar fallout and digital decay. Play as a hired blade taking dangerous contracts to survive. Master fast, skill-driven combat, and explore a fractured megacity across neon streets and a corrupted Cyberverse!","steam_appid":3066300,"support_info":{"email":"orbitgamedev@gmail.com","url":"https://orbitstudio.com.br/"},"supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil","type":"game","website":null}